prompt:
La plantilla administrada `AWS-Download-File` genera este documento de trabajo. ¿De dónde salen los valores que sustituyen a los `${aws:iot:parameter:...}`?
```json
{
  "version": "1.0",
  "steps": [
    {
      "action": {
        "name": "Download-File",
        "type": "runHandler",
        "input": {
          "handler": "download-file.sh",
          "args": [
            "${aws:iot:parameter:downloadUrl}",
            "${aws:iot:parameter:filePath}"
          ],
          "path": "${aws:iot:parameter:pathToHandler}"
        },
        "runAsUser": "${aws:iot:parameter:runAsUser}"
      }
    }
  ]
}
```
